{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">元朗驚現 P 牌司機逆線倒車狼狽場面。網絡近日瘋傳一段影片，顯示在元朗青山公路潭尾段，有一輛掛着 P 牌的私家車疑不慎行錯路，於行車道路上逆線行駛。期間司機發現前方有一輛巴士駛近，隨即慌忙切換倒車擋試圖駛離。然而，該名 P 牌司機疑因極度緊張，倒車時不僅反覆多次扭軚，更在混亂間直接撞倒路壆上的雪糕筒。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-02-12h04m34s959.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20268jm8KoLx0n1790914784.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-02-12h04m34s959.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-02-12h05m15s958.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026QyUIf8PDed1790914777.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-02-12h05m15s958.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">片段引發網民圍觀及熱議，眾人紛紛對該司機的駕駛水平提出批評與嘲諷：</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">·       技術質疑派：大批網民認為其技術嚴重不足，留言指：「補下鐘啦」、「咁簡單都揸成咁，搞咁多嘢乜料」，更有網民狠批：「重考個牌啦！」</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">·       幽默同情派：亦有部分網民將焦點放在被撞物件上，打趣留言：「個雪糕筒好慘」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T04:39:05.702881+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":303,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}